   <div id="ctl00_radTipMyNasdaqTeam" style="display:none;position:absolute;">
	
     
    <h2>My Nasdaq Analyst</h2>
    Every Nasdaq-listed company has a dedicated Listing Qualifications Analyst.  Get to know them! They are available to answer your questions, Monday through Friday between 8 a.m. and 5 p.m. ET.  <br /><br />
    
